### Get all
GET http://localhost:8080/employees

### Get one
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/2

### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lina",
  "salary": 2500
}

### Update employee 2
PUT http://localhost:8080/employees/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sara Ali",
  "salary": 1800
}

### Update non-existing
PUT http://localhost:8080/employees/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost",
  "salary": 1000
}

### Delete employee 3
DELETE http://localhost:8080/employees/3

### Get deleted employee
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/3